686	/// it: unpromoted packages keep a `Bare` id; a package only gets a
687	/// `Prefixed` id when it collided with a same-named package in another
688	/// ecosystem. Trying `Bare` first and falling back to `Prefixed` mirrors
689	/// that: a package is never registered under both forms at once.
